WEBVTT

00:00:57.804 --> 00:01:00.973
Say, instead of wondering
how to bring science

00:01:01.015 --> 00:01:03.142
and policy to communities,

00:01:03.142 --> 00:01:06.312
how about we find a way
to bring the voice

00:01:06.354 --> 00:01:11.484
and centenary knowledge of communities
to research and policy making?

00:01:12.151 --> 00:01:17.824
But see, the answer to such questions
is never a one-size-fits-all solution,

00:01:17.865 --> 00:01:21.744
because it needs to be tailored
to the unique environmental,

00:01:21.786 --> 00:01:25.706
social and economic realities
of each community.

00:01:26.290 --> 00:01:27.959
Let me give you some context.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:33.297
I get to work in one of the most
incredible wetland systems on Earth.